# Manifest for the restricted repository "Dynamic Theory: GR and SM".
# Holds ONLY what the Physica Scripta manuscript relies on, plus dependencies.
# The Layer-1 foundations are adopted in the manuscript without derivation, so
# their code stays in the full repository only.
# The restricted repo is GENERATED from this list by export/export_gr_sm.py;
# never edit the generated copy. Each .sage brings its sage-results/*.out.txt,
# each .lean its lean-results/*.out.txt (if any), each .cdb its cadabra-results.
# "## " lines are section headings, reused in the generated README.
# The token after each script is its step tag(s) in the Supplementary Materials
# (F = Sec. S2, G = S3, S = S4, P = S5); the export writes it into the header.

## The 5D manifold, five-force and 5D Dirac ansatz (manuscript Sec. 2.2, 4.1)
